	)
	(text "500kHz; VOUT = 0.795 x (1 + 316k/100k) = 3.307V nominal.\nMPPC tied to VCC (disabled). PWM/SYNC = GND (Burst allowed).\nSGND and PGND meet at exposed-pad ground; honor TA06 layout.\nD1: anode=3V3, cathode=VCC; do not short VCC to 3V3."
